            "verseId": "2CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.27.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 27:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku za utawala wa Jehoramu, atu a Edomu arema kutawalwa kula Juda, achitawaza mfalume wao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehoramu wavuka na akulu a jeshire phamwenga na magarige gosi ga kuvwehwa ni farasi. Usiku wakpwendaapiga Aedomu osi ambao kala akamzangira iye phamwenga na akulu a jeshi a magarige ga kuvwehwa ni farasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo ndivyo atu a Edomu arivyorema kutawalwa ni Juda hadi rero. Wakati uho-uho atu a mudzi wa Libuna nao piya arema utawala wa Jehoramu mana wamricha Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa akaree.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuuya phapho, iye wadzenga mwatu mwa dzulu mwa ibada hiko tsi ya myango ya Juda na achiakoseza enyezi a Jerusalemu uaminifu na achiahenda aaphuke njira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wareherwa baruwa kula kpwa nabii Elija, ichimuamba, “Hivi ndivyo Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa sowe Daudi anavyokuamba, ‘Kpwa kukala kukalunga njira za sowe Jehoshafati, wala njira za Asa mfalume wa Juda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela ukalunga njira za afalume a Iziraeli. Atu a Juda na enyezi a Jerusalemu ukaalongoza kuabudu vizuka dza vira Ahabu na nyumbaye arivyohenda. Piya ukaolaga enenu, ana a sowe ambao kala ni atu anono kuriko uwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kukala ukahenda mai higo Mwenyezi Mlungu andareha mashaka makulu kpwa atuo, anao, acheo na kpwa maliyo yosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na we mwenye, undagbwirwa ni ukongo mui wa mahumbo ambao undazidi chila siku, undalumwa sana hadi mahumbogo gatuluke kondze.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
