          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Mwenyezi Mlungu achiafyakatsira Afilisti na Arabu ambao kala ni majirani na Akushi apigane na Jehoramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ashambuliya Juda achihala mali yosi ariyoiphaha nyumbani mwa mfalume, phamwenga na anae na achee. Wasazirwa mwana mmwenga tu mdide, yeihwa Jehoashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya higo kuhendeka, ndipho Mwenyezi Mlungu achimrehera Jehoramu ukongo wa mahumbo usiophola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukongo wa Jehoramu waenderera kuzidi na kufikira mwisho wa mwaka wa phiri wa ukongowe mahumboge gatuluka na achifwa kpwa maumivu makali. Wala atue taayaasa moho mkpwulu kumupha ishima dza arivyohenderwa akaree.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
